Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 14:47:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Lapin UX: real-hardware fixes and requests

- Pages fill the content panel at any window size (no 1000 px cap), same
  edges everywhere. znraznra/lapin-ux#11
- Mouse: "Reverse scrolling direction"; Touchpad: Windows' "Scrolling
  direction" drop-down (the same natural-scroll settings, wheel and
  touchpad separately). znraznra/lapin-ux#6
- Start: "Show apps from other desktops" (off). znraznra/lapin-ux#7
- Taskbar: "Start button icon" (Lapin UX, Dots, Circle, Rabbit, the
  system's logo, or a custom SVG/PNG copied to ~/.local/share/lapin-ux).
  znraznra/lapin-ux#17
- The account picture in the sidebar is cut to a circle, whatever its
  shape (it was drawn as a rounded rectangle). znraznra/lapin-ux#8
